<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>运维 on Aliya の 笔记</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/tags/%E8%BF%90%E7%BB%B4/</link><description>Recent content in 运维 on Aliya の 笔记</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 09:20:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/tags/%E8%BF%90%E7%BB%B4/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>VPS 内核崩溃取证</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/vps-%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%B4%A9%E6%BA%83%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 09:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/vps-%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%B4%A9%E6%BA%83%E5%8F%96%E8%AF%81/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-180.avif" alt="Featured image of post VPS 内核崩溃取证" />凌晨一点内核崩了，机器半死挂到早上七点。日志里挖出的根因不是&amp;quot;容器太多&amp;quot;，而是三个容器配了 interval=0 的健康检查——检查完立刻开始下一轮，无限循环</description></item><item><title>模型网关升级与多重免费备用链实录</title><link>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%BD%91%E5%85%B3%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%9A%E9%87%8D%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%A4%87%E7%94%A8%E9%93%BE%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 11:55:14 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://note.zhongyangblog.eu.org/p/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%BD%91%E5%85%B3%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%8E%E5%A4%9A%E9%87%8D%E5%85%8D%E8%B4%B9%E5%A4%87%E7%94%A8%E9%93%BE%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://jsd.1143520.xyz/gh/manji1143/picx-images-hosting@master/paste/random-003.avif" alt="Featured image of post 模型网关升级与多重免费备用链实录" />把某家 AI 客户端的账号变成 OpenAI 兼容接口，再挂四层免费备用模型。这篇记录了升级时的三个坑、健康检查与回滚脚本、备用链的排序原则，以及哪些运维该交给定时任务。</description></item></channel></rss>